## Phase 1 — Server Functions & Data Layer (Foundation)

Create TanStack Start server functions (run on the server, called from the client) to query the database with Prisma. This is the backbone everything else depends on.

### Data Access Layer

#### [NEW] `src/lib/api/agents.server.ts`
- `getAgents()` — all agents with customer count & policy count
- `getAgentById(id)` — single agent with related customers & policies
- `createAgent(data)` / `updateAgent(id, data)` / `deleteAgent(id)`

#### [NEW] `src/lib/api/customers.server.ts`
