- Test create/edit/delete operations and verify changes persist in DB

### Manual Verification
- Open each page and compare the numbers with raw SQL queries in phpMyAdmin
- Test search/filter functionality on Policies, Customers, Claims pages
- Test the role switcher (Admin/Agent/Customer) to verify data is properly scoped

